From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Baptiste Augrain <daiyam@zokugun.org>
Date: Sat, 1 Jan 2000 00:00:00 +0000
Subject: replace hardcoded VS Code product name with !!APP_NAME!! token in
 extensions and installer

Bundled extensions and the Windows installer hardcode "Visual Studio Code" / "VS Code" in user-facing strings; tokenizing them to !!APP_NAME!! lets the build materialize the VSCodium brand at build time instead of shipping the upstream name.

